8. Costs and the unresolved full operation

The writer’s polynomial claim includes its geometry and transport. In the notation of the detailed construction,

 $Q_{\mathrm{grid}}
\le
C_{\mathrm{grid}}
(D_N+2R_{r_0}+2L_{r_0}+1)^3,$ and a conservative duration bound is

 $T_W\le
G\tau_F^{r_0}
+
\sum_j
\left[
C_{\mathrm{dec}}\tau_F^{r_j}
+
C_{\mathrm{move}}M_{r_j}^{4}
\tau_F^{r_{j+1}}
\right]
+
T_{\mathrm{final}}.$ The work bound also charges the entire provisioned grid’s waiting activity. Route matching, coloring, every stored program word, sampler randomness, finite synthesis precision and compiler-failure budgets are included in the package’s formulas. These are computable polynomial bounds in  $N,\delta^{-1}$ , with potentially enormous constants.

They do not close three remaining obligations.
